  "remarks": "Joint Stock Company “ABS ZEIM Automation” is a Russian company producing automated control systems for industrial companies, in particular in the energy sector. One of the main activities of Joint Stock Company “ABS ZEIM Automation” is to supply equipment to oil and gas refining, storage or transport facilities operated by major Russian oil and gas companies. The energy sector, in particular the oil and gas sector, is a sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation.",
